ErnestREDAs:
REDA [19,7] 0x0 1 0x0 20
REDA [18,7] 0x0 1 0x0 0

ErnestAppears:
EVBIT_T 9
SOUN 0xD8
LOAD1 1 ErnestBlock
ENUN
SVAL s1 0xB
SET_HP Ernest
CUMO Ernest
STAL 60
CURE
Text(0x919)
SVAL s1 0x00000000
CHAI CityGuardFighter
SVAL s1 0x00000000
CHAI CityGuardKnight
SetToPursue(CityGuardMage)
NoFade
ENDA

ConditionalSoldier:
CHECK_EXISTS CityGuardKnight
BNE 4 sC s0 //if he's alive, skip to label 4 and do nothing, else keep reading
CHECK_EXISTS CityGuardMage
BNE 4 sC s0 //if he's alive, skip to label 4 and do nothing, else keep reading
LOAD1 0 ScrubSoldier
ENUN
LABEL 4
SVAL s1 0x00001200
CHAI [18,1]
NoFade
ENDA

BigBrawl:
EVBIT_T 9
LOAD1 0 RaiderGroup
ENUN
CUMO [1,12]
STAL 60
CURE
Text(0x920)
NoFade
ENDA

Turn5EnemyReinforcements:
EVBIT_T 9
LOAD1 0 Turn5EnemyLancers
ENUN
NoFade
ENDA

ConditionalThief:
//CALL 0x815E72D
//BNE 5 sC s0 //if the player has a Door Key, jump to LABEL 5 and do nothing, else keep reading and load the thief
LOAD1 0 Turn10CleanupThief
ENUN
//LABEL 5
NoFade
ENDA

NavarroConvo:
MUSC 0x31
Text(0x923)
ENUT $03
CALL Ch1EndingScene
NoFade
ENDA

RecruitErnest:
MUSS 0x30
Text(0x9CC)
SetToPursue(Ernest)
REVEAL Ernest
CUSA Ernest
NoFade
ENDA

AltoSupply:
MUSI
Text(0x91C)
MUNO
SVAL s1 OldFriend
GIVEITEMTO Daphne
NoFade
ENDA

KanSupply:
MUSI
Text(0x921)
MUNO
SVAL s1 Vulnerary //change this to whatever the strawberry jam is
GIVEITEMTO Daphne
NoFade
ENDA

HandAxeHouse:
MUSI
SetBackground(0x0)
Text(0x91B)
EndConvo
MUNO
SVAL s1 HandAxe
GIVEITEMTO 0xFFFF
TILECHANGE 0x2
NoFade
ENDA

InnConvo:
MUSI
SetBackground(0x9)
Text(0x91A)
EndConvo
NoFade
ENDA

ch1Armory:
SHLI IronSword IronLance Javelin IronAxe IronBow
BYTE 0 0 0 0
ALIGN 4

ch1Shop:
SHLI Fire Heal Vulnerary Antitoxin DoorKey
BYTE 0 0 0 0
ALIGN 4

NowTalkToNavarro:
NoFade
ENDA

Ch1BeginningScene:
LOAD1 0 MainEnemy
ENUN
LOAD1 0 MainEnemy2
ENUN
CAM1 [15,17]
STAL 10
FADU 16
STAL 10
LOAD1 1 DaphneParty
ENUN
CUMO Daphne
STAL 60
CURE
SetBackground(0x2)
Text(0x910)
EndConvo
EVBIT_T 9
STAL 5
CUMO [13,19]
STAL 60
CURE
Text(0x912)
CAM1 [11,17]
MoveByCoords(60, 11, 17, 12, 19)
ENUN
Text(0x913)
STAL 10
MoveByCoords(60, 12, 19, 13, 7)
ENUN
SetBackground(0x5)
Text(0x914)
EndConvo
STAL 30
CAM1 Daphne
Text(0x911)
STAL 10
MUSC 0x25 //Tension, currently
SetBackground(0x2)
Text(0x915)
EndConvo
CUMO Daphne
STAL 30
CURE
SetBackground(0x2)
Text(0x91E)
EndConvo
STAL 20
LOAD1 1 AltoParty
ENUN
CUMO Alto
STAL 60
CURE
SetBackground(0x5)
Text(0x91F)
ENDA

Ch1EndingScene:
FADI 16
CLEN Navarro
CLEA Daphne
CAM1 [13,3]
FADU 20
STAL 60
SetBackground(0xF)
CHECK_EXISTS Ernest
BNE 1 sC s0 //if Ernest is alive, jump to LABEL 1, otherwise keep reading
Text(0x938) //dead
GOTO 3
LABEL 1
CHECK_ALLEGIANCE Ernest
BEQ 2 sC s0 // if Ernest is allied, jump to LABEL 2, otherwise keep reading
Text(0x9F7) //alive but not allied
GOTO 3
LABEL 2
Text(0x937) //alive and allied
LABEL 3
MNC2 Ch2
ENDA

MESSAGE Events end at offset CURRENTOFFSET